[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キュウゥ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyuu..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物の子ども",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster Offspring"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この程度でいいよね？\u3000やっぱやりづらいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's enough, right? This really doesn't sit well with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。悪いね、気分の悪いことをやらせてしまって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Sorry for making you do something so unpleasant."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グオオォォォッ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "GUOOOOH!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なッ……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What—?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ああ、親御さんの登場ってわけかい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ah, looks like mommy and daddy decided to show up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ、こいつは手強い！\n「管理」対象だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka, this one's tough! They're management targets!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってる。今度はアタシが手を汚す番さ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know. This time it's my turn to get my hands dirty..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ギャオラァッ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "GYAORAA!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁっ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaah!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キュウン……クゥン……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyuun... Kuun..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物の子ども",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster Offspring"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……忘れるんじゃないよ、お前さんの親の仇は\nこのアタシだ。大きくなって仇を討ちに来な",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Don't forget, kid—I'm the one who killed your parent. Grow up, and become stronger, then come back for your revenge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クゥン……グル……グルルルゥ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kuun... Gru... Grururuu..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物の子ども",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster Offspring"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……今、ここで殺してあの世で親に会わせてやるのも\n粋だと思うけどねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You know, putting it out of its misery here so it could reunite with its parents in the afterlife would be a pretty chic thing to do too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "悪いがアタシは死後の世界がどうなってるか\n知らないんでね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry, but I don't know what happens after we die..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにアタシはこの子まで殺したくはないし……\nこの子の生きる目的を与えてやりたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, I don't want to kill this little one... I want to give it a reason to live."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでわざわざ憎まれ役を？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you're deliberately playing the villain?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。これもアタシが背負うべき業の１つさ。\nそれにね、考えてもごらんよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. It's just another burden I have to carry. And think about it—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "親の仇討ち以上の粋があるかい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is there anything more chic than avenging your parent's death?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ、屈折してるというか……\nイェルカも擦り減ってるねぇ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh* Talk about twisted logic... You're really wearing yourself thin, aren't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グルルルル……グルルルル……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grurururu... Grurururu...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物の子ども",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster Offspring"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]